
{
  "content": "<p>This collection of problem sets and exams given in past years are affectionately known as the <em>7.03 Bible</em>. Using these along with your assignments will give you a great deal of help in this class.</p>\n<p>Each link is to one PDF per year which includes all the problem sets and their solutions, or all the exams and their solutions.</p>\n<p><table>\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<th>\n\nproblem sets\n</th>\n\n<th>\n\nexams\n</th>\n</p>\n</tr>\n\n<p></thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n2003 (<a href=\"../../resources/ps_2003/index.html\">PDF - 1.9 MB</a>)\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n2003 (<a href=\"../../resources/exams_2003_keys/index.html\">PDF - 2.9 MB</a>) - Answer keys only\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n2002 (<a href=\"../../resources/ps_2002/index.html\">PDF - 1.1 MB</a>)\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n2002 (<a href=\"../../resources/exams_2002/index.html\">PDF - 2.6 MB</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n2001 (<a href=\"../../resources/ps_2001/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n2001 (<a href=\"../../resources/exams_2001/index.html\">PDF - 1.6 MB</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n2000 (<a href=\"../../resources/ps_2000/index.html\">PDF - 1.4 MB</a>)\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n2000 (<a href=\"../../resources/exams_2000/index.html\">PDF - 2.3 MB</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n1999 (<a href=\"../../resources/ps_1999/index.html\">PDF - 1.6 MB</a>)\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n1999 (<a href=\"../../resources/exams_1999/index.html\">PDF - 1.9 MB</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n1998 (<a href=\"../../resources/ps_1998/index.html\">PDF - 1.3 MB</a>)\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n1998 (<a href=\"../../resources/exams_1998/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n1997 (<a href=\"../../resources/ps_1997/index.html\">PDF - 1.6 MB</a>)\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n1997 (<a href=\"../../resources/exams_1997/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n1996 (<a href=\"../../resources/ps_1996/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n\n<